{"title":"the minty clarity of virgo I, the craft","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/virgo-i-the-craft","date":1757317988000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8cee2e7d-b864-4dbf-a15b-b5434dfd1f50/VirgoI.png?format=1000w\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8cee2e7d-b864-4dbf-a15b-b5434dfd1f50/VirgoI.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8cee2e7d-b864-4dbf-a15b-b5434dfd1f50/VirgoI.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8cee2e7d-b864-4dbf-a15b-b5434dfd1f50/VirgoI.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8cee2e7d-b864-4dbf-a15b-b5434dfd1f50/VirgoI.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8cee2e7d-b864-4dbf-a15b-b5434dfd1f50/VirgoI.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8cee2e7d-b864-4dbf-a15b-b5434dfd1f50/VirgoI.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8cee2e7d-b864-4dbf-a15b-b5434dfd1f50/VirgoI.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n \n\n\n  <p><em>an illustration for my collaboration with LJ of </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Ceremony</em></a><em> for their communal writing practice, </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Atmospheres</em></a><em>, guided by the 36 decans of the astrological year. all illustrations and writings are inspired by LJ’s work. </em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p><strong>VIRGO I</strong> — 23 August – 3 September<br /><strong>KEY THEMES</strong> <strong>FROM LJ</strong> — daily wonders, mundane magic, ancient traditions<br /><br />I’ve begun a creative collaboration with LJ of Ceremony for their new communal writing practice, <a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\">Atmospheres</a> — in which each astrological season will be subdivided into three 10-day decans — each decan as <em>“tiny containers of zodiacal time to sift ideas, feelings, and observations.”</em> They’ve made potions out of each decan — essentially, a digital bottle of curated ideas, perspectives, and inspiration to help evoke new ways of relating to your writing, and storytelling craft. </p><p>beyond limited client work, I don’t do collaborations often (barely at all), but working with LJ has been a hermit Scorpio’s dream — of voyaging into the mysterious corners of my psyche, and feeling a greater sense of expansion, spaciousnesness, softness. I can already see the ripples of this work flowing through my own work.  </p><p>*</p><p>today, I’m sharing the first illustration I made for Atmospheres — the image of a hermit holding a lantern of minty light — to represent the clarifying magic of the everyday mundanities. </p><p>I figured out the composition of this illustration in 10 minutes, then spent another hour refining it. <br /><br />atmospheres will be a year-long practice. the first session will be opening this week, September 11. I have no doubt it will be anything but magical. you can explore it more <a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <h1>the process</h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8930b749-f477-43a6-bef3-12f868e1b6fa/Virgo+Process+Video.gif?format=1000w\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8930b749-f477-43a6-bef3-12f868e1b6fa/Virgo+Process+Video.gif?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8930b749-f477-43a6-bef3-12f868e1b6fa/Virgo+Process+Video.gif?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8930b749-f477-43a6-bef3-12f868e1b6fa/Virgo+Process+Video.gif?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8930b749-f477-43a6-bef3-12f868e1b6fa/Virgo+Process+Video.gif?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8930b749-f477-43a6-bef3-12f868e1b6fa/Virgo+Process+Video.gif?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8930b749-f477-43a6-bef3-12f868e1b6fa/Virgo+Process+Video.gif?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8930b749-f477-43a6-bef3-12f868e1b6fa/Virgo+Process+Video.gif?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p>go to <a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\">atmospheres</a><br />all <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tag/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\">atmospheres illustrations</a> <br />more <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\">visual art</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  ","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"89d619e500d7853298d42f9c973b35b8ec2135c78b222043df75da4d8ea51f36","category":"Sites"}